# Day 05 - Number Operations

A Java console-based practice project created as part of my 30-Day Java Learning Journey.

## 🎯 What This Project Does

This project performs different operations on a number entered by the user:

- Checks whether the number is Even or Odd
- Calculates the Sum of its digits
- Reverses the number
- Checks whether the number is a Palindrome

## 📚 Java Concepts Used

- Scanner
- User Input
- Variables
- if-else
- while loop
- Arithmetic operators
- Modulus operator (%)
- Basic problem-solving and logic

## ▶️ How to Run

Compile:

javac Main.java

Run:

java Main

## 💻 Example

For the input:

472

The program produces:

Even
Sum: 13
Reverse: 274
Palindrome: No

